its own upstream license:

- FST baseline:      Apache 2.0 (https://github.com/efficient/SuRF)
- CoCo-trie:         GPLv3       (https://github.com/aboffa/CoCo-trie)
- MARISA:            BSD 2-Clause (https://github.com/s-yata/marisa-trie)
- CTrie++:           MIT         (https://gitlab.com/ofek.gila1/ctriepp)
- ART / C-ART:       Apache 2.0  (header-only, ./baseline_art/include/)
- PDT:               BSD-style   (header-only, ./baseline_pdt/include/)
- ds2i / sdsl-lite / sux / fsst: see their respective LICENSE files under lib/

When redistributing this release, the most restrictive component license
(currently GPLv3 from CoCo-trie) governs the combined work.
